WEBVTT

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:09.980
This is a work of fiction based on research into the period in which it is set. The people,
 organization, laws, and names that appear in it have no relation to any in the real world.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.510
Vampires...

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:01.520
...there are two roads open to you.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:03.640
One.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:07.480
Obey us, Special Forces Unit 16,

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:11.190
and you will receive blood and registrations.

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:15.910
Two.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:17.990
Refuse to obey, and...

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:20.580
Vampire!

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.140
Let me in!

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:41.310
Please! Open the door!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.640
Stop!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.980
Stay back!

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.520
Special forces?

00:03:34.070 --> 00:03:37.910
I'm Lieutenant Shutaro Kurusu,
Special Forces Unit 16!

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:42.120
Excuse me, but do you know
where everyone else is?

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:04.260
Purgatory

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:07.680
What a crummy world we live in.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.940
The quake's only just died down,
and now it's vampires.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:14.070
What's the world coming to?

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:16.400
Aren't you going to run, Santaro?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.030
Don't talk nonsense!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.450
I was born and raised in Asakusa.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:22.450
I'm a natural-born Asakusa man!

00:04:22.450 --> 00:04:25.290
I've made up my mind to die here, too!

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:29.120
Still, these are dangerous times.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.580
Even Tenmanya went off someplace.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.340
Any idea where?

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.500
I'm lookin' for him myself,

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.920
but I haven't got a clue.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.430
Hey, Santaro.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.100
You get the vaccine from the army?

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:44.470
What bad scene?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.680
Moron!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:49.640
<i>Vaccine! </i>The disease will turn
you into a vampire without it!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.100
What disease?

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.980
Oh, yeah, the army guards
said something like that.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.320
Have you two had it, then?

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.860
You bet!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:03.200
Hey!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:04.910
Thank you for patrolling!

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:06.080
Thanks!

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.410
Rations from the general.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.880
Thank you.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.800
Keep a close watch, okay?

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.050
Get to it!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.480
All right, form a line!

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.150
Get your free bread here!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:39.990
Here you go.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:42.740
Thank you.

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.570
Here you--

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.950
Good work.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:48.330
Boss! What are you doing here?

00:05:48.330 --> 00:05:52.620
I should be asking you how
you ended up helping out here.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.580
We're all in the same boat.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:58.000
And I'm out of work since
the newspaper went under.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.510
Not so fast. I'm restarting it tomorrow.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:01.380
What?!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.010
I got a hotel room.

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:06.640
Who's going to write about
this vampire incident if we don't?

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:08.470
I've been waiting!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.140
I can have all of it?

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.440
Nope! This flapper's going reporting!

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:14.350
Hand it out!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.190
Hey!

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:17.060
Leave it to a flapper!

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.700
What is it?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.200
Just seeing things... I think.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.000
Aoi,

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:37.630
I'm glad you're safe.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:41.760
Heave-ho!

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:47.050
It won't come down easy.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:51.140
I wish we were on vampire disease
guard duty instead of this job.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.220
Got the vaccine?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:55.390
After this. You?

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.560
Took it as my evening drink.

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:17.750
Are you okay?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.670
Y-Yeah.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.130
We owe you one.

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.710
Are you...?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.550
Excuse me!

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:28.470
Lieutenant Shutaro Kurusu,
Special Forces Unit 16!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:29.640
Special forces?

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:31.720
I've never heard of it.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:32.560
Oh!

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:33.970
What's that smoke?!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.430
Huh?

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:35.680
You're suspicious!

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.020
Take off that cloak!

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:37.900
That's...

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.650
Show us your face now!

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.440
What?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:50.490
A vampire?

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.120
H-Hey!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.630
What happened?!

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.920
He... burnt up.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.970
What?

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:28.030
Where should I go?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.860
"Tenmanya"

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:33.280
The time I spent with everyone

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.950
is vanishing.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.750
I want to see them.

00:08:50.380 --> 00:08:52.390
Lantern plants...

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:53.300
Oh.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:56.640
YAMAGAMI

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:10.320
Excuse me, do you need something?

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.280
My name is Kurusu.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.700
Mr. Yamagami looked out for me in our unit.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.250
My goodness.

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:23.170
After the summer quake,

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:24.880
well...

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:28.550
I was worried if you were all right.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.630
Thank you very much.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:34.300
Compared to others, we don't
have much to complain about.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.680
I'm glad.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:41.520
I see that my husband really was
surrounded by kind people.

00:09:41.520 --> 00:09:45.610
People? Has anyone else been here?

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:49.230
It was a night about ten days
after the earthquake, I think.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:57.450
There was a tall soldier
standing in front of our gate.

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.290
A tall soldier?

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:03.620
Umm, did he tell you his name? Or his unit?

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.920
I don't know.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:10.010
But he wore the same uniform as you.

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:15.180
He wore his cap low over his eyes,
so I wasn't able to see his face.

00:10:16.390 --> 00:10:18.470
Still,

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:22.060
he left this on the ground.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:24.480
It was my husband's.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:31.440
What was my husband like in the army?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.540
Yamagami was...

00:10:40.540 --> 00:10:47.330
...kind of a snob, always dressing up,
and constantly scolding me,

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:53.760
but he was an incredibly warm, kind person.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.760
That sounds just like him.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:26.120
I would expect no less.

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:30.590
Production is overwhelmingly faster
than when I did it myself.

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:35.510
I take it this is part of modernization.
What they call "mass production"?

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:39.180
It's being produced at
top priority in Koishikawa.

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:44.480
The government is seriously concerned
about this vampire disturbance,

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.560
so I squeezed it through.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:51.440
And I suppose that's also a part
of the scene you're painting,

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.690
right?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:57.990
Only that earthquake was outside the frame.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.500
♪ Oh, Danny Boy... ♪

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.380
Get your vampire disease vaccine here!

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:14.670
Mom, can I drink this?

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:17.260
Once we get home.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.350
I hear the dyer became a vampire, too.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:30.150
It's frightening.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.390
The curtain rises.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.180
Help!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.640
The roof?

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.860
Ayame!

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:15.730
It's fine.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.900
I'll protect you.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:22.950
Vampires?

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:29.950
Are you okay?

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:31.170
Yes.

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.290
Vampires! There are two--

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.670
Talking to them doesn't work!

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:39.210
Those people are all... crazy now.

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:42.510
They got like that when they took the vaccine.

00:13:42.510 --> 00:13:43.840
How do you--

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.930
Help!

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:47.510
Stay back!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.440
I'm scared.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:57.520
Huh?

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:01.490
Yoh says he's scared of you, mister.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:04.450
Sorry. I won't do anything to you.

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.700
I promise.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.580
I know. But there's something...

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.370
I'll explain everything later.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:15.250
They probably won't
attack you if you're with me.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.460
Now, let's go.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.710
Okay.

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.680
Sir!

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.100
Mr. Code Zero!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.350
Huh?

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.030
Mr. Tenmanya?

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.610
We'll talk later. This way.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:45.410
Don't worry.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.570
He's on our side.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:15:01.260
I heard rumors that child vampires
were in hiding near Kanda.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:04.220
The head clerk and I went to check.

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:07.140
That was when I heard the screams.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:08.760
So, that's what happened.

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:11.970
I happened to be here
right when the earthquake hit.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:14.060
It saved my life.

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:16.310
The shop's ahead?

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.940
Exactly.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:23.570
If the main entrance is our public face,
this is our entirely private one.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:30.700
I'm sheltering vampires
with nowhere left to go here.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:41.420
What happened to all of you, sir?

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:44.260
That's what I'd like to know.

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:47.720
I got washed away in the quake, then nothing.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:53.220
Who are those uncomfortably dressed men?

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.930
Vampire units.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.190
Artificial vampires that Ltg. Nakajima made.

00:15:58.190 --> 00:15:59.400
"Artificial"?

00:15:59.400 --> 00:16:03.070
They were made using the Ascra
we showed you before.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:06.110
That crude blood substitute for vampires?

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:08.860
But Ltg. Nakajima said he used it

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:13.450
to turn all the special forces
soldiers into vampires.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.330
I see. That explains it.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:17.160
Huh?

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:20.710
Evidence is better than argument.
I'll show you inside.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:24.050
You come, too, children. I'll give you blood.

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.960
I'm thirsty.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:30.840
Tenmanya welcomes your patronage.

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:50.990
This is the vampire disease vaccine
making the rounds right now.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.530
I drank that!

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:54.870
You, too, right?

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:56.660
Yeah.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:16:59.830
You mean...?

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:06.880
Then, I got thirsty all of a sudden.

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:12.050
The next morning, the other kids
with us burned up in the sunlight.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:17.390
I wasn't in the sun because
Yoh was making a fuss.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.140
Where did you get blood?

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.440
From rats!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:21.980
It tasted awful, though.

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:24.270
Ayame taught us how.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.610
You're quite clever.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:30.030
I had people who were kind to me.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.030
But

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:34.030
the red specs got them, and...

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:37.870
You've had a hard time of it
for such young children.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.040
Aren't you a kid, too, mister?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:44.710
I'm glad you can still muster
such a sharp tongue.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:48.260
Head clerk, prepare a meal for these children.

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:52.510
Come, this way.

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:54.930
But I'm not hungry.

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:58.720
By "meal," we mean blood to feed on.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.230
Have no fear.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:02.940
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.310
What will happen to those kids?

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.690
They'll have to be strong.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:13.950
Now, I believe you want information
about the other members of Code Zero,

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.700
but I haven't heard any rumors of them.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.910
I see.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:24.630
But if you stay here, all vampire
rumors will come to you.

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:27.800
Besides which, vampires are our customers.

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:29.130
Stay with us.

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:31.220
Thank you very much.

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:33.430
But won't I be a nuisance?

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:35.390
These are dangerous times.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.760
It's give-and-take, Mr. Code Zero.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:45.770
I want you to investigate something.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:53.610
Manseibashi
Suehirocho

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:50.980
Head clerk, what is this place?

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:53.990
A planned subway construction site.

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:56.950
Only one side of the track is finished,

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:59.790
so it won't be operational for a while yet.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:01.950
The subway...

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:05.000
Does it go to Tsukishima Island, too?

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:09.130
What did we come here to check?

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:12.460
Do you recall that, at the Asakusa store,

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.430
the young master once
mentioned registration papers?

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:19.220
Mr. Tenmanya manages them, right?

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:26.310
We cannot provide all vampires with homes.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.690
Some cannot adapt to new lives

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:35.030
and are forced to live
out of sight of the public.

00:19:35.030 --> 00:19:38.910
The least that Tenmanya can do for them

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:42.950
is to periodically supply them with nourishment.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.960
There sure is a lot.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:49.170
Hopefully, these haven't been
swapped out for the vaccine.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.050
They seem fine.

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.010
Yes.

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:02.100
There are too many of them left.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:06.310
What's wrong?

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:10.060
It appears we are already in the enemy's hands.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.400
Vampire units?!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.740
Oh, my.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:19.030
We have a bigger fish
in our net than I anticipated.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:21.240
Special forces soldiers! It's me!

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:23.290
It's Shutaro Kurusu!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:25.410
Aren't we all comrades?!

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:32.460
I'm not much to look at, but I, Ishikawa,
am still Tenmanya's head clerk.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:37.840
I cannot allow harm to befall a valued customer!

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:46.680
Do my words not reach you anymore?!

00:21:21.970 --> 00:21:24.810
It will soon be dawn. Take this chance.

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:26.100
Right.

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:33.810
Danny Boy, what have you done?

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:35.570
You're a bad boy.

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:45.620
And bad boys must be punished,

00:21:45.620 --> 00:21:46.790
right?

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:51.370
We made it, somehow.

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:55.790
Now, I shall inform the young master at once.

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:02.590
Where

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:04.600
are all of you?

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:46.900
Suspicion
